crafty - usage and license notice
=================================

Copyright (c) 2026 the crafty authors.

AUTHORIZED TESTING ONLY
-----------------------
crafty is offensive security tooling. It is intended SOLELY for lawful use:
your own lab, or assessments where you hold explicit written authorization and a
defined scope. Its poisoning, spraying, and rogue-listener capabilities put real
attacks on real wires. Using it against systems you do not own or are not
explicitly authorized in writing to test may be illegal and is not supported.

crafty gives you dials to match an engagement's noise budget. It never claims to
make your activity invisible: completed TCP handshakes are logged, and poisoning
puts wrong answers on the wire that canaries can catch.

